---
import { site } from '../data/site';
import Icon from './Icon.astro';
---

<section class="about-section section" id="about" aria-labelledby="about-title">
  <div class="container about-layout" data-reveal>
    <div>
      <p class="section-kicker caption-1">
        <span class="section-number">02</span>Behind the projects
      </p>
      <h2 class="heading-2" id="about-title">
        Hi, I’m Simon.
        <br />
        I like making
        <br />
        things work.
      </h2>
    </div>
    <div class="about-copy">
      <p class="body-3">
        My background is in Linux systems and DevOps. I spend a lot of time with
        the things behind the screen: automation, containers, and the systems
        that keep everything running.
      </p>
      <p class="body-3">
        These projects are the other side of that. A place to follow an
        interest, try an idea, and build something friends and colleagues can
        actually use.
      </p>
      <ul class="about-tools caption-1" aria-label="Tools I work with">
        <li>Linux</li>
        <li>Python</li>
        <li>Docker</li>
        <li>Kubernetes</li>
      </ul>
      <a
        class="text-link title-3"
        href={site.github}
        target="_blank"
        rel="noopener noreferrer"
      >
        GitHub <Icon />
      </a>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
